; ${APP_NAME} Setup's English text: Tauri's own English file (tauri-cli 2.12) with plainer wording for
; closing ${APP_NAME}, for replacing an older version (installer/installer.nsi then only removes the old
; files, see "[APP]" there) and for the uninstaller's "delete data" box ("Also delete my notes", Dobo's exact label). Tauri needs every
; string it uses here: after a tauri-cli update, compare with its English.nsh and add any new one.
LangString addOrReinstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Add/Reinstall components"
LangString alreadyInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Already Installed"
LangString alreadyInstalledLong ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${PRODUCTNAME} ${VERSION} is already installed. Select the operation you want to perform and click Next to continue."
LangString appRunning ${LANG_ENGLISH} "{{product_name}} is open. Close it first, then try again."
LangString appRunningOkKill ${LANG_ENGLISH} "{{product_name}} is open.$\nClick OK to close it and continue."
LangString chooseMaintenanceOption ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose the maintenance option to perform."
LangString chooseHowToInstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Choose how you want to install ${PRODUCTNAME}."
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Create desktop shortcut"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Do not uninstall"
LangString dontUninstallDowngrade ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Do not uninstall (Downgrading without uninstall is disabled for this installer)"
LangString failedToKillApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't close {{product_name}}. Close it first, then try again."
LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing WebView2..."
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A newer version of ${PRODUCTNAME} is already installed! It is not recommended that you install an older version. If you really want to install this older version, it's better to uninstall the current version first. Select the operation you want to perform and click Next to continue."
LangString older ${LANG_ENGLISH} "older"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_ENGLISH} "An $R4 version of ${PRODUCTNAME} is installed. ${APP_NAME} Setup replaces it: your notes, settings, shortcuts and taskbar pin stay. Click Next to continue."
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downgrades are disabled for this installer, can't proceed with the silent installer, please use the graphical interface installer instead.$\n"
LangString unableToUninstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Unable to uninstall!"
LangString uninstallApp ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall ${PRODUCTNAME}"
LangString uninstallBeforeInstalling ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Replace the installed version (recommended)"
LangString unknown ${LANG_ENGLISH} "unknown"
LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Failed to install WebView2! The app can't run without it. Try restarting the installer."
LangString webview2DownloadError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Error: Downloading WebView2 Failed - $0"
LangString webview2DownloadSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 bootstrapper downloaded successfully"
LangString webview2Downloading ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Downloading WebView2 bootstrapper..."
LangString webview2InstallError ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Error: Installing WebView2 failed with exit code $1"
LangString webview2InstallSuccess ${LANG_ENGLISH} "WebView2 installed successfully"
LangString deleteAppData ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Also delete my notes"
; [APP] A silent or passive install's folder check (installer/hooks.nsh: AppCheckDir).
LangString appDirNotWritable ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} Setup installs ${APP_NAME} for you only, without admin rights, so it needs a folder you can change. Windows doesn't let you change $INSTDIR (folders like Program Files need admin rights).$\n$\nPick another folder, for example $LOCALAPPDATA\Programs\${APP_NAME}."
LangString appDirNotWritableSilent ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} Setup installs ${APP_NAME} for you only, without admin rights, so it needs a folder you can change. Windows doesn't let you change $INSTDIR (folders like Program Files need admin rights). Pick another folder with /D=, for example /D=$LOCALAPPDATA\Programs\${APP_NAME}$\n"
; [APP] ${APP_NAME} Setup's own window (installer/ui.nsh). Plain words, the window's exact labels.
LangString appVersion ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Version ${VERSION}"
LangString appTag ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_TAGLINE}"
LangString appTagUpdate ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Updates ${APP_NAME} $AppOldVersion to ${VERSION}"
LangString appTagSame ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} ${VERSION} is installed: this installs it again"
LangString appTagOlder ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Puts back ${APP_NAME} ${VERSION} (you have $AppOldVersion)"
LangString appUpdateTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Update ${APP_NAME}"
LangString appInstallIn ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Install in"
LangString appChange ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Change"
LangString appPickFolder ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pick where to install ${APP_NAME}. ${APP_NAME} gets a folder of its own in it."
LangString appDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Desktop shortcut"
LangString appStartWithWindows ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Start ${APP_NAME} with Windows"
LangString appBrowsers ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Connect ${APP_NAME} to your browsers"
LangString appBrowsersSub ${LANG_ENGLISH} "So the browser extension can talk to ${APP_NAME}"
LangString appTermsA ${LANG_ENGLISH} "By installing, you accept the "
LangString appTermsAUpdate ${LANG_ENGLISH} "By updating, you accept the "
LangString appTermsLink ${LANG_ENGLISH} "terms of use"
LangString appTermsB ${LANG_ENGLISH} "."
LangString appNoAdmin ${LANG_ENGLISH} "No admin rights needed."
LangString appFolderAdmin ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Windows only lets admins change this folder, so ${APP_NAME} couldn't update itself there. Pick a folder of yours."
LangString appFolderWrite ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Windows doesn't let you change this folder. Pick a folder of yours."
LangString appFolderMissing ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This drive or network folder can't be reached. Pick another folder."
LangString appFolderLong ${LANG_ENGLISH} "This folder's path is too long for Windows. Pick a shorter one."
LangString appMoveHint ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Click Change: ${APP_NAME} moves to the folder you pick, and your notes stay."
LangString appMoveNote ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} moves to this folder. Your notes stay."
LangString appChangeName ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Change folder"
LangString appOpenName ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Open ${APP_NAME}"
LangString appPrevSlide ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Previous slide"
LangString appNextSlide ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Next slide"
LangString appChoicesFailed ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_CHOICES_FAILED}"
LangString appFailInstall ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't finish installing: Windows didn't allow writing in $INSTDIR."
LangString appFailFile ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Couldn't replace $AppFailName: another program may be using it. Close it, then run ${APP_NAME} Setup again."
LangString appFolderData ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} keeps your notes in this folder. Pick another one."
; [APP] WebView2's data folder (app.nsh APP_WEBVIEW_DIR): not the notes.
LangString appFolderWebview ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} keeps its own files in this folder. Pick another one."
LangString appFolderPortable ${LANG_ENGLISH} "A portable ${APP_NAME} is in this folder. Pick another one, so its notes stay with it."
LangString appFolderPick ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Pick a folder to install ${APP_NAME} in."
LangString appIsOpen ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} is open: Setup closes it first. ${APP_IS_OPEN_NOTE}"
LangString appInstalling ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing ${APP_NAME}…"
LangString appUpdating ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Updating ${APP_NAME}…"
LangString appInstallingAgain ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing ${APP_NAME} again…"
LangString appInstallingOlder ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Installing ${APP_NAME} ${VERSION}…"
LangString appDone ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} is installed"
LangString appDoneUpdate ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} is up to date"
LangString appDoneAgain ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} is installed again"
LangString appDoneOlder ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} ${VERSION} is installed"
LangString appDoneWhere ${LANG_ENGLISH} "You'll find it in the Start menu."
LangString appDoneWhereDesktop ${LANG_ENGLISH} "You'll find it in the Start menu and on your desktop."
LangString appClose ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Close"
LangString appUnTitle ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Uninstall ${APP_NAME}"
LangString appUnText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} will be removed from this PC. ${APP_UN_KEEPS}"
LangString appUnDataSub ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_UN_DATA_SUB}"
LangString appUnPrivate ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_EXTRA_DATA_LABEL}"
LangString appUnPrivateSub ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_EXTRA_DATA_SUB}"
LangString appRemoving ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Removing ${APP_NAME}…"
LangString appUnDone ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_NAME} is uninstalled"
LangString appUnDoneText ${LANG_ENGLISH} "${APP_UN_DONE_TEXT}"
; [APP] The line under the progress bar while ${APP_EXE} is copied: "Copying ${APP_EXE}... 40%".
LangString ^Extract ${LANG_ENGLISH} "Copying "
